# .env IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE — do not add it back to this list.
#
# Vite replaces `import.meta.env.VITE_*` at BUILD time, so the deploy build
# reads these values out of the repo. Untracking .env is what took
# moots.lovable.app down with "Missing Supabase environment variable(s)".
#
# It may only ever hold publishable values (SUPABASE_URL,
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY, SUPABASE_PROJECT_ID and their VITE_ twins) —
# every one of those already ships inside the browser bundle by design.
#
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY MUST NOT GO IN HERE. It is read from process.env
# by src/integrations/supabase/client.server.ts: locally that means .env.local
# below, and on the deploy it comes from the Lovable Cloud secret store.
# A VITE_ prefix on it would publish it to every visitor.
!.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

